Additional notice (not part of the licence grant, and not a restriction on it)

This project is designed for a context where a wrong output can cost lives.
Anyone reusing this code should read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and the model card
served at `GET /api/v1/risk/model` first. The risk engine is a transparent
susceptibility prior with hand-set weights; it is not a trained failure
predictor, and the seeded terrain and population data are demonstration
approximations, not surveyed values.

Third-party data and libraries carry their own terms, including OpenStreetMap
attribution and the Open-Meteo non-commercial licence. See
`submission/AI_AND_THIRD_PARTY_DISCLOSURE.md`.
